Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? How's the coin search going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, your sister came by recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... And he was with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure that you had told them about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that. I'm neutral here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is for you to gather coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As thanks, I will make your wishes come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Many people have died for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Each person is responsible\Nfor how they use their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am really impressed though.\NYou all are truly amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you use your powers,\Nthe powers you seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so very unique,\Nfar more so than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your sister, a normal person\Nwith no special powers--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,she got everyone out of that terrible mess!\NAnd what an amazing approach!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kill you, this pointless\Nconflict would end, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so. In my current form,\NI'm just a human, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that the conflict would end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you do, nobody can stop\Nthe things that have already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The flames are dying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, can you smell anyone following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:02:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't be sure with all the smoke...\NBut I think we lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How many died? It doesn't feel real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to carry\Nthe burden of any more crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that, but I still feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Traveling over this mountain\Nis more difficult than I expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and the time we took fighting\Nthem has put us off schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly how effective\Nthe oleander's poison is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If some of them managed to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...they've seen our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to gather 100 coins\Nand put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel like the things that happened today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,are way more than all\Nof us can deal with at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pick another route and head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good, I can't get through to Ikeuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's not out of the mountains yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for today. I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone did survive, they're going\Nto hold a strong grudge against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be very careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Other groups might turn into monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to see things\Nthrough the way I am, as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:04:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans live by ideals and\Nwill not give in to their vulgar urges--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to declare this to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But my own ideals lead us\Nto that foolish bloodbath!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Ikeuchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your devotion to your ideals\Nis a beautiful and precious thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what anyone says--\NI'll always trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to heat this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No... It's not right for me\Nto rely on your affection like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shift is starting. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Put something cold on it, Isao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... Yota...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I didn't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. You stood up and defended us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she think of something so terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with Shuichi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been weird right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was the only student\Nat Yamada Cram School--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But that can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How... How can they be so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:06:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as though this\Nisn't the first time they've...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Do you think everyone\Nin that group is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But we didn't\Nhave any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't done it, we'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fa--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw our faces, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If one of them is alive,\Nwe'll always be living in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.95,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I thought about our group,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized it'd be better\Nif the other group was all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty messed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's because\NI got you wrapped up in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I think this is my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, right? How my memory\Nof the time I got my powers has gaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it was Elena that\Nmade me take that medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one that chose to turn into a costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I need to use that power to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and that feeling keeps\Ngetting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean... with Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Sometimes it feels\Nthat way, sometimes it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find the answer myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I do, I feel like I'll truly\Nbecome one with you, for the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi... Do you want to go...\Nhang out somewhere tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We could go see that movie you mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we shouldn't be going\Nanywhere people will see us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, why don't we rent a movie\Nand watch it at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we can... fool around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? You did it with that helmet girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No I didn't! That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that was her way of showing she cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The next day, I went to school,\Njust like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she goes to our school, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So... If, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if someone had already gathered 100 coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think they'd wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought everyone would\Nsimply want all their desires fulfilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,like that group yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... If it was me,\NI don't think I'd use them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Sorry. I didn't have\Nanything to talk about, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just scared from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We should pretend we don't\Nknow each other here, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be sure there aren't\Npeople from that group here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you sense danger,\Ncontact me right away. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief. Nothing on the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like nothing ever happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To think we were fighting for our lives...\NIt doesn't feel real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to live out every day normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Abukawa?\NWasn't he absent yesterday, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I haven't been able to get\Nin touch with him for two or three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The change happened slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Abukawa didn't come to school\Nthe next day, or the day after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Abukawa had been acting weird lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hanging out with some\Nsketchy guys from another school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, did you hear? They found a body\Nin the river, in the next town over!\N--Stop it, Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.87,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was totally burned all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people are saying it was Abukawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day I set fire\Nto those beautiful flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...I lost a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Just you today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I've got to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know why I chose the costume\Nas my power--what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't avoid the question!\NIs Elena keeping you quiet somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If she were to hear that,\NI think she might get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll you do if you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For you humans, there are some\Nthings that are better left forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care! Just tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do? Do you want\Nto quit this coin-gathering game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You got pulled into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you quit, nobody can blame you,\Nand it won't hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They might be happy, actually.\NEven your nice freckled girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You could just relax\Nand forget about all this fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got coins, I'll take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, I can put you\Nback to your original form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"We are not monsters, we are humans!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"We are humans, and we are here\Nto end this meaningless game."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And he said, "I want to make idiots,\Nlike my friends here, happy."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"They're important to me, see?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them might have been\Ntaking this game too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But both of them were striving\Nfor something, in their own ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of the things they did were unforgivable,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but they just wanted things\Nto be a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be so... For her, and for Abukawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just keep looking\Ndown on us like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a human, but you\Ndon't have feelings like us, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to end this terrible game\Nas soon as I possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If that means I need to collect 100 coins\Nbefore anyone else, then that is what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take back my lost memories\Nand the normal lives Clair and I once had!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you are mistaken about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am indeed the source\Nfrom which these evils came...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But the game is not what we imagined\Nit would be--it's on its own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop it at this point.\NIt's become a process of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you still want to\Nsee it through to the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, what more is there to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I get my companions back,\NI'll be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Abukawa notice I was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was he with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't matter\Nwhat kind of person he was--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,my crimes won't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody will be able to see us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some business with me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't care about collecting coins anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to get revenge for Madoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That group was all I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed that Madoka could change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Five of us died in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and those that survived made it down off\Nthat mountain because Madoka died for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the girl with the freckles?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. This guy probably\Ndoesn't have any power by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to have the girl\Ninside him to gain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it... She killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire in the forest,\Nyour friends getting burned to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know a high school student named Abukawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He should have been one of your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Why was he with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he join a group\Nthat could kill so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Abukawa wasn't like that!\NHe was kind! He was just!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Abukawa I knew was not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So... You didn't know\Nanything about him, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is two-faced.\NAbukawa was a good friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He too died trying to save our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Madoka seemed like\Nthe devil to you, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...but to me, he was hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Can we meet up? I need to talk to you.\N--It was clear when we fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she did it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Clair. It's okay.\N--Revenge... For Madoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm not the\Nmain character in this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For... Madoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bare feet sure do hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it feels good. You really feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are amazing. It's just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:18:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my ship crashed\Nand my friends were flung all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this isn't what I actually look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I actually look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you want to look\Nfor those friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm... I don't really feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all completely jaded at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal life sounds good,\Nbut you could also say we gave up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,our attachment to life, to evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you really call that living?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, it's just kind of a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you should look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be lonely by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that the feeling of loneliness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You're just hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The sensation of consuming food\Non an exceedingly unhygienic planet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that is covered with germs and microbes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. It's delicious.\NIt makes you feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Please allow me\Nto express my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at body upgrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you like\Nto shoot lasers out of your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to hold back. I can grant any wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got an idea! You don't want\Nto look for them yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get people to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks like coins here on earth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You could put a vending machine here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and when someone puts a coin in,\Nyou grant their wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:19:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that an interesting idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is. Why don't\Nwe start with your wish, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the first one to find a coin for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka. I want to make your wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the future you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hotel Mythos"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hotel Mythos"\NYour friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hotel Mythos"\NYeah, my friends. If I tell them\Nabout you, I'm sure they'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my friends. If I tell them\Nabout you, I'm sure they'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine. I'm not too\Ngood around people, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.87,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, they're all friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, humans are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They are so kind... So ruthless...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:21:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this. Did we find it?\NIs this where it crashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. I can't allow anyone to take these coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I was going to kill you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to know you're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, it pains me\Nslightly to kill good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:22:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my story. A story about my crimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The ending is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Honoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.37,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 12: Where the Promise Was Made"
